-- =============================================================================
-- nebula_builtins.nelua -- Pre-built UI Component Producer Generators
--
-- Provides reusable DenseText Producer generators for nebula_app's builtin field.
-- Each builtin is registered via nebula_register_builtin().
--
-- ★ Phase 5.2 R4: Refactored from string templates to AST-based code generation.
-- All source code is now generated via builtin_factory.lua's AST nodes + emit,
-- replacing fragile %s-heavy string.format templates with composable, testable
-- AST node trees.
--
-- Compile-time only, zero runtime overhead.
-- =============================================================================

require "nebula_core"

